# The menus and the keyboard on a desktop (1280 x 800): Settings (a toggle, the theme), Scores (a tab),
# Achievements, the Daily and Challenge setups, then a Practice round played by keys: the board cursor
# (arrows), select / connect (Enter), hint (H), undo (U), add rows (A), pause (Esc), Help from the pause
# card and back to it, Leave round, Continue round from the title, Restart round, the profile name.
# viewport 1280x800@1
until 600 Daily challenge
frames 10
click =⚙️ Settings
until 120 Captions for sounds
